    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Loubieh bil zeit is made by stewing green beans slowly in olive oil until they are very soft, almost collapsing. This is a bil zeit dish: the olive oil is the central ingredient, flavouring the beans throughout rather than acting as a cooking medium."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: this dish should not be rushed. Thirty minutes on a low heat is the minimum. The beans should be very tender, not squeaky."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
